[API Documentation]
Compute grid sample.

    Given an :attr:`input` and a flow-field :attr:`grid`, computes the
    ``output`` using :attr:`input` values and pixel locations from :attr:`grid`.

    Currently, only spatial (4-D) and volumetric (5-D) :attr:`input` are
